      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COMPLETE (2) finished in the minors last start over the 425m at this track but ran a sharp 24.03 last start. Can measure up if runs up to latest time. RIPPER KEV (3) has been a little hard to follow, finishing out of the placings latest but was in winning form two back scoring in a Mix 6/7 at Shepparton. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. BASH BOY GIBLET (7) broke a string of placings finishing in the money four on end before a last start fourth (30.54) at The Meadows. Has ability and can measure up. FLEX GOODALL (1) is a Briana Robertson Leech-trained newcomer by Tommy Shelby out of Mepunga Gem. Drawn well and should get his chance. Can run a bold race on debut.",
